                      <items count="7">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Outer boundary curve. If provided, this will become the outer boundary of the resulting mesh. Any of the inputs that are completely outside of the outer boundary will be ignored and have no impact on the result. If any of the input intersects the outer boundary the result will be unpredictable and is likely to not include the entire outer boundary.</item>
