                              <Y>1333</Y>
                            </item>
                          </items>
                        </chunk>
                      </chunks>
                    </chunk>
                    <chunk name="param_input" index="5">
                      <items count="7">
                        <item name="Access" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">1</item>
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Optional points used to generate the mesh. If the Outer Boundary is not empty, points outside of that boundary after it has been pulled to the pullback Surface (or the best plane through the inputs if no surface is provided) will be ignored.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">b1f765a5-2df1-44ba-8d97-0056117ad8f7</item>
                        <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Points</item>
